  "body_html": "<h1>Myerson Payment Formula</h1>\n<p>For single-parameter mechanisms over real values, the Myerson module defines\nthe canonical payment formula associated to an allocation rule and records the\nzero-normalized payment condition.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, def:md_myerson_payment_interface] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
